* {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
** The [[instant attack]] component additionally has the following properties:
*** Does not utilize attack {{M|projectiles}}. Hence, the instant attack component does not {{M|miss}} for both {{M|melee}} and {{M|ranged}} units.
** Affects {{M|spell immune}} units only if the {{M|attack modifier}} applied pierces spell immune sources.

* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** All ability effects are applied immediately despite the visual effects.
** Applies a particle effect visually on the affected enemy unit upon an {{M|instant attack}} application, with a different <ab>Kez Echo Slash 2.mp3</ab> sound effect.

* {{Symbol|fx|s}}
** Plays a different <ab>Kez Echo Slash 1.mp3</ab> ability sound effect when the instant attack component does not affect any enemy units.
** For {{M|fogged}} units, the <ab>Kez Echo Slash 2.mp3</ab> ability sound effect is played without additional visual particles.

