 {{Katanacard|name=Grappling Claw|linkspl=Talon Toss}}

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Interrupts Kez's {{M|channeling}} abilities upon cast.

* The ability has three main components:
** The launched {{M|projectile}} upon cast.
** The {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} projectile impact properties.
** The ability effects {{Symbol|Caster|Leap}} upon landing.

* [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|21px|1]] {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Launches a {{#var:Grappling Claw basic1}}-speed [[projectile]] upon cast.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*** Does not disable Kez while the projectile is traveling.
** {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Issues an attack order on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy upon cast.
*** Hence, the attack order is neither affected by {{M|Spell Block}} sources, nor is nullified when the ability is {{M|disjointed}}.
** {{to}} {{Symbol|Trees}}
*** Does not destroy the tree once the Grappling Claw projectile stops pulling.

* [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|21px|2]] {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
** The following ability effects are applied upon {{M|projectile}} impact, and are nullified upon being {{M|disjoint|text=disjointed}}.
** {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Applies the {{M|movement speed}} slow.
*** Considers the following enemy units as valid units upon projectile impact:
**** {{M|Dead}} units.
**** {{M|Hidden}} units.
**** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
** {{to}} {{Symbol|Trees}}
*** Trees within 100-radius centered around Kez are destroyed upon landing.
*** Destroying the targeted [[tree]] neither nullifies the ability's traveling component, nor affects the travel distance.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Run}}
*** Applies a {{M|disable|text=disabling}} {{M|forced movement}} that moves Kez to the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy or {{M|tree}}'s current location in {{#var:Grappling Claw value2}}-speed upon projectile impact.
*** Can move over {{M|impassable terrain}} and over trees.
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|{{!}} KezLocation - EnemyLocation {{!}} ≥ 2000-distance}}
**** Pulls Kez {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} targeted unit's current location.
**** When {{Code|< 2000-distance}}, the ability pulls Kez a short distance upon impact.

* [[File:Dota2 Condition-3.png|21px|3]] {{Symbol|Caster|Leap}}
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** No longer {{M|disarms|x}} Kez upon landing.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Applies an {{M|instant attack}} with the the following properties on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy upon landing:
**** Procs any {{M|attack modifiers}} and {{M|on-cast effects}} as per normal.
**** Does not have {{M|True Strike}}.
**** Affected by {{M|disarm}} sources.
*** {{Symbol|Lifesteal}}
**** The lifesteal component does not affect {{M|attack immune}} units.
**** Stacks additively with other lifesteal sources.
**** Considers {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}}, and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes.


